{"termId": "122841924357", "name": "Plant", "fqn": "Supply Chain.Plant", "kind": "ENTITY", "domain": "Supply Chain", "owner": "Supply Chain", "status": "ACTIVE", "description": "A manufacturing site. Carries capacity (work centres, hours, spare units) and inventory (days of cover, stock value) as properties, because both are 1:1 with the plant rather than entities in their own right. A kind of Facility. In the supply chain model: A Plant can substitute for another Plant (N:N). A Plant produces a Material Category (N:N). A Plant ships to a Customer (N:N). A Plant transfers material to another Plant (N:N). A Sales Order is fulfilled by a Plant (N:1). A Supplier supplies a Plant (N:N). A System Serial is built at a Plant (N:1). An Equipment is installed at a Plant (N:1). Source: Supply Chain Ontology app, SAP_SUPPLY_CHAIN.ONTOLOGY.", "synonyms": [], "appClass": "Plant", "edges": [{"type": "CUSTOM", "label": "fulfilled by", "direction": "in", "node": "Sales Order"}, {"type": "CUSTOM", "label": "supplies", "direction": "in", "node": "Supplier"}, {"type": "CUSTOM", "label": "owned by", "direction": "out", "node": "Legal Entity"}, {"type": "CUSTOM", "label": "ships to", "direction": "out", "node": "Customer"}], "representations": [{"object": "V_PLANT_CAPACITY", "fqn": "SAP_ENTERPRISE_ONTOLOGY.SCENARIO.V_PLANT_CAPACITY", "objectType": "View", "role": "DESCRIBES", "validity": "VALID"}, {"object": "DT_OPERATING_RATE", "fqn": "SAP_SUPPLY_CHAIN.ANALYTICS.DT_OPERATING_RATE", "objectType": "Table", "role": "DESCRIBES", "validity": "VALID"}, {"object": "DT_COMPONENT_COVER", "fqn": "SAP_SUPPLY_CHAIN.ANALYTICS.DT_COMPONENT_COVER", "objectType": "Table", "role": "DESCRIBES", "validity": "VALID"}, {"object": "V_PLANT_BUFFER", "fqn": "SAP_ENTERPRISE_ONTOLOGY.SCENARIO.V_PLANT_BUFFER", "objectType": "View", "role": "DESCRIBES", "validity": "VALID"}, {"object": "V_SUBSTITUTION", "fqn": "SAP_ENTERPRISE_ONTOLOGY.SCENARIO.V_SUBSTITUTION", "objectType": "View", "role": "DESCRIBES", "validity"